brand: Never Summer
model name: Mens Proto T3 FR
model year: 2027
AUD price: $1,049.99
availability status: Preorder
estimated availability: June 1, 2026
available sizes: 152cm, 156cm, 160cm, 157cm Wide, 161cm Wide, 165cm Wide, 162cm Drag Free, 166cm Drag Free
board type: All Mountain-Freeride
flex: 7/10
rider level: Intermediate-Advanced
shape: Tapered Directional (tail narrower than nose for enhanced control and stability in deeper snow)
camber type: Triple Camber Hybrid with R.I.P. Edge Hold Technology (overall central rocker shape with camber zone creating two high-pressure rocker sections on each side of middle camber)
edge technology: R.I.P. Edge Hold Technology (integrates waves into base creating high-pressure points for smooth drag-free rides and consistent pressure on edge)
width options: Standard, Wide, Drag Free
width - drag free: For riders with biggest size boot, typically US 14+
sidecut: Power Grip Sidecut (multiple radii with flat section in middle, two shallow radii on either side, deeper radii near tips)
mounting pattern: 2x4 Inserts
topsheet: Co-Extruded Polymer Topsheet with T3 Directional Carbon Mapping Embossment (tough lightweight thermoplastic with fiber backing, built-in stomp pad grip)
laminate: Bi-Lite Fiberglass, Precision Stitched Carbon Matrix, STS Pre-Tensioned Fiberglass
laminate detail - Bi-Lite: Lightweight glass fiber matrix for freestyle and freeride performance
laminate detail - Carbon Matrix: Specific layup of carbon fiber precisely stitched and integrated into construction
laminate detail - STS: Pre-tensioned fiberglass with elastomer stringers between glass fibers to improve strength and edge hold
core: WooBoo Wood Core (Bamboo stringers, Paulownia, Poplar, and Birch)
core damping: Triple Layer RDS 2 Damping (balance between freeride stability and freestyle responsiveness)
core stabiliser: Elastomeric Underfoot Stabilisers (positioned beneath mounting area for shock and vibration absorption)
sidewalls: UHMW Sidewalls (Ultra High Molecular Weight Polyethylene, more resistant to cracking in cold temperatures than ABS)
edges: Fullwrap Metal Edge
base: Durasurf XT Sintered 5501 Base (high performance sintered base infused with graphite)
additional features: Extended Transition Area, Early-Rise Float Mechanics, P-Tex Nose/Tail Protection
